COMPILATION OF: E52I

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52I

   1 a 0000 E52I:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-52/P1] THREE SCOPES, INNER TEST THROUGH MID (prescan_cond
   4 a 0006      consumer): main x dec(4,2) stores 3; mid m declares x dec(9,2)
   5 a 0006      and stores NOTHING; innermost n tests x > 0 and stores x = 1.
   6 a 0006      Lexical typing sizes BOTH condition and store literals at
   7 a 0006      dec(9,2): pool 3 + 5 + 5 = 13, DATA 21 with the two variable
   8 a 0006      cells. A main-only environment sizes them at dec(4,2): pool 9,
   9 a 0006      DATA 17. DATA-SIZE discriminates the prescan_cond consumer
  10 a 0006      path directly. MINE refuses today (main vs mid clash). */
  11 c 0006   dcl x fixed dec(4,2);
  12 c 0006   x = 3;
  13 c 0016   call m;
  14 c 0019   m: procedure;
  15 e 0019      dcl x fixed dec(9,2);
  16 e 001C      call n;
  17 e 001F      n: procedure;
  18 g 001F         if x > 0 then x = 1;
  19 e 0049         end n;
  20 c 004A      end m;
  21 a 004A end E52I;

CODE SIZE = 004D
DATA AREA = 0015
FREE SYMS = 3864
END  COMPILATION
